{"path":"/how-we-work/","slug":"how-we-work","kind":"how-we-work","title":"How We Work | The Evidence Engine | Legency Media","description":"The Evidence Engine is how Legency Media runs a retainer: build component systems in your Slack, measure rankings, conversions and AI citations, report monthly with evidence you can take upward. Security posture, MSA and SOW paper, and PO billing included.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/how-we-work.DBdYCRzD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"hw-hero\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"hw-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></div><div class=\"container hw-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>How We Work</span><h1 class=\"hw-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>How We Build,<br data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Measure and Report</h1><p class=\"hw-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>One shared plan for your website, search and AI visibility, and conversion. Each month you see what shipped, what the results show and what we recommend doing next.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Discuss your priorities</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><!-- A jump link keeps the scope available from the opening screen. --><a class=\"hw-hero__jump\" href=\"#ai-readability-score\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>See what an AI visibility read includes<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><path d=\"M9 2v13M3.5 9.5 9 15l5.5-5.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"section loop\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"loop__head\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The Evidence Engine</span><h2 class=\"loop__heading\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Three Stages,<br data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Running on a Loop</h2><p class=\"loop__intro\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Building the site is stage one. The Evidence Engine keeps going: it measures what the build earned, then reports it in a form your leadership can act on. Each report sets the next month of work.</p></div><div class=\"loop__row\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><article class=\"loop-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"loop-card__top\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"loop-card__chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7.5\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"1.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"3\" width=\"7.5\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"1.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7.5\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"1.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></rect><path d=\"M17.25 13.5v7.5M21 17.25h-7.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></span><span class=\"loop-card__n\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>01</span></div><h3 class=\"loop-card__name\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Build</h3><p class=\"loop-card__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Your team ships without waiting on a developer</p><p class=\"loop-card__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Requests land in a shared channel and ship inside an agreed turnaround, so a campaign page never waits behind the product roadmap. Everything is built as reusable components, so volume gets cheaper as you go: one rollout put 205 new answers live across a six-site estate, each one tied to an article already published there.</p></article><span class=\"loop__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><path d=\"M2 9h13M10 3.5 15.5 9 10 14.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></span><article class=\"loop-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"loop-card__top\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"loop-card__chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><path d=\"M3.5 20.5h17\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path><path d=\"M6.5 20.5v-5M11 20.5V9M15.5 20.5v-8M20 20.5V4.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></span><span class=\"loop-card__n\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>02</span></div><h3 class=\"loop-card__name\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Measure</h3><p class=\"loop-card__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>You find out which channel earns the demos</p><p class=\"loop-card__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>On one account organic search overtook paid as the top source of demo requests: 39 people against 19 in a 28-day window. We track rankings, conversion on the pages that matter, and whether ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude cite you.</p></article><span class=\"loop__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><path d=\"M2 9h13M10 3.5 15.5 9 10 14.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></span><article class=\"loop-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"loop-card__top\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"loop-card__chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><path d=\"M6 2.5h7.5L19 8v13.5H6z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path><path d=\"M13.5 2.5V8H19\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path><path d=\"M9 12.5h6M9 16h4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></span><span class=\"loop-card__n\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>03</span></div><h3 class=\"loop-card__name\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Report</h3><p class=\"loop-card__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A report you can forward without rewriting it</p><p class=\"loop-card__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>One a month, same format every time, numbers first. Our longest-running account has had 18 months of them, so month 18 compares to month one in ten seconds. Where a number moved the wrong way, it says so and says what changes.</p></article></div><p class=\"loop__return\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"loop__return-icon\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><path d=\"M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.6-5.9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path><path d=\"M20 3.5V7h-3.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></path></svg></span>Then it loops. This month's evidence writes next month's build plan.</p><div class=\"numbers\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><h3 class=\"numbers__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>What this looks like in numbers</h3><div class=\"numbers__grid\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"stat\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><span class=\"stat__value\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>0 to 475</span><span class=\"stat__label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>pages made machine-readable for AI engines, in two months</span></div><div class=\"stat\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><span class=\"stat__value\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>385</span><span class=\"stat__label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>pages given the search snippet they were missing</span></div><div class=\"stat\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 9L18.005 20.3463C17.8369 21.3026 17.0062 22 16.0353 22H7.96474C6.99379 22 6.1631 21.3026 5.99496 20.3463L4 9\"/><path d=\"M21 6L15.375 6M3 6L8.625 6M8.625 6V4C8.625 2.89543 9.52043 2 10.625 2H13.375C14.4796 2 15.375 2.89543 15.375 4V6M8.625 6L15.375 6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"stat__value\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>-83%</span><span class=\"stat__label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>crawler time lost to junk URLs, 2,349 down to 410</span></div><div class=\"stat\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14 14V6M14 14L20.1023 17.487C20.5023 17.7156 21 17.4268 21 16.9661V3.03391C21 2.57321 20.5023 2.28439 20.1023 2.51296L14 6M14 14H7C4.79086 14 3 12.2091 3 10V10C3 7.79086 4.79086 6 7 6H14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7.75716 19.3001L7 14H11L11.6772 18.7401C11.8476 19.9329 10.922 21 9.71716 21C8.73186 21 7.8965 20.2755 7.75716 19.3001Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"stat__value\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>3 of 4</span><span class=\"stat__label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>AI engines that name a client for its speciality</span></div></div><p class=\"numbers__foot\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Measured on live client engagements. Each figure stays anonymous until that client clears being named.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section split-feature\" id=\"astro-builds\" aria-labelledby=\"astro-builds-title\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw><div class=\"container split-feature__grid\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw><div class=\"split-feature__copy\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw>Development approach</span><h2 id=\"astro-builds-title\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw>Astro builds with a shared design system</h2><div class=\"split-feature__body\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Some sites belong in Astro: a content-heavy site that has to load fast on every page, or one that lives in a code repository beside the product. We build those on the same design system as our Webflow work, so a page looks and behaves the same whichever platform it ships on, and your brand holds together across both.</p><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Before the build starts, your team sees how the reusable sections work and tries the editing workflow, so publishing a page after handover is something marketing does without a developer. We also agree who reviews changes and who looks after the code once the site is live, so nothing depends on one person.</p></div><div class=\"split-feature__actions\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw><a class=\"split-feature__link\" href=\"/services/astro-agency/\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw>Astro web development <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw>↗</span></a></div></div><img src=\"/img/covers/building-astro-websites-with-lumos.jpg\" alt=\"A modular facade at night in blue pixel dither, captioned Built on Lumos\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw></div></section><section class=\"airband\" id=\"ai-readability-score\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"band-scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\"></div><div class=\"container airband__inner\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"airband__content\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>What We Measure With</span><h2 class=\"airband__heading\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The AI Readability Score</h2><p class=\"airband__lead\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>You get one number, 0 to 100, for whether ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude can use your pages when a buyer asks a question in your category. It is our own 100-point audit, and it is re-run line by line so the movement is measured rather than asserted.</p><p class=\"airband__note\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A low score explains why a strong site goes unnamed when an assistant answers. The read finds the causes, puts them in the order worth fixing, and the number moves as those fixes land.</p><div class=\"airband__cta\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your AI Visibility Read</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></div><div class=\"airband__panel\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><h3 class=\"airband__panel-title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>What a read includes</h3><ul class=\"airband__list\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><div class=\"airband__line\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><strong data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Every page, checked</strong><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>How many of your pages parse cleanly for a machine, and how many are invisible.</span></div></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M3 17.4V6.6C3 6.26863 3.26863 6 3.6 6H16.6789C16.8795 6 17.0668 6.10026 17.1781 6.26718L20.7781 11.6672C20.9125 11.8687 20.9125 12.1313 20.7781 12.3328L17.1781 17.7328C17.0668 17.8997 16.8795 18 16.6789 18H3.6C3.26863 18 3 17.7314 3 17.4Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><div class=\"airband__line\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><strong data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Snippets and metadata</strong><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The pages going out to search and AI engines with nothing to say about themselves.</span></div></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 9L18.005 20.3463C17.8369 21.3026 17.0062 22 16.0353 22H7.96474C6.99379 22 6.1631 21.3026 5.99496 20.3463L4 9\"/><path d=\"M21 6L15.375 6M3 6L8.625 6M8.625 6V4C8.625 2.89543 9.52043 2 10.625 2H13.375C14.4796 2 15.375 2.89543 15.375 4V6M8.625 6L15.375 6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"airband__line\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><strong data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Crawl waste</strong><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>How much crawler time is spent on junk URLs instead of the pages that earn citations.</span></div></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"airband__line\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><strong data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Schema coverage</strong><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Whether an engine can tell what each page is: a service, an article, a case study, a question.</span></div></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12H5C4.44772 12 4 11.5523 4 11V7.5C4 6.94772 4.44772 6.5 5 6.5H9C9.55228 6.5 10 6.94772 10 7.5V12ZM10 12C10 14.5 9 16 6 17.5\"/><path d=\"M20 12H15C14.4477 12 14 11.5523 14 11V7.5C14 6.94772 14.4477 6.5 15 6.5H19C19.5523 6.5 20 6.94772 20 7.5V12ZM20 12C20 14.5 19 16 16 17.5\"/></svg></span><div class=\"airband__line\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><strong data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A citation baseline</strong><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Where you are named today across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude, and who is named instead.</span></div></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><div class=\"airband__line\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><strong data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A ranked fix list</strong><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The changes that move the score most, in order, with the effort each one takes.</span></div></li></ul><figure class=\"meter\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><figcaption class=\"meter__cap\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A recent client moved from 30 to 59 in two months.</figcaption><div class=\"meter__track\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"meter__fill\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></span><span class=\"meter__pin meter__pin--from\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><i data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></i>30</span><span class=\"meter__pin meter__pin--to\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><i data-astro-cid-uahrdstm></i>59</span></div><div class=\"meter__scale\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>0</span><span data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>100</span></div></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"section proc\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"proc__head\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Procurement Readiness</span><h2 class=\"proc__heading\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Your Legal, Security and<br data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Finance Teams, Answered</h2><p class=\"proc__intro\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Reviews are where new agency relationships stall. We arrive with the paperwork already done, so yours takes days instead of quarters.</p></div><div class=\"proc__grid\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><article class=\"proc-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M16 12H17.4C17.7314 12 18 12.2686 18 12.6V19.4C18 19.7314 17.7314 20 17.4 20H6.6C6.26863 20 6 19.7314 6 19.4V12.6C6 12.2686 6.26863 12 6.6 12H8M16 12V8C16 6.66667 15.2 4 12 4C8.8 4 8 6.66667 8 8V12M16 12H8\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Security posture</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Least-privilege access, credentials in a managed vault, and a named contact for your security team. Nothing reaches a production site without your sign-off - changes are staged first, every time.</p></article><article class=\"proc-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Enterprise due diligence, passed</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A 36-question enterprise cyber due diligence questionnaire, run by a client security team, answered and accepted. Your reviewers get straight answers instead of a sales deck.</p></article><article class=\"proc-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M8 10L16 10\"/><path d=\"M8 18L16 18\"/><path d=\"M8 14L12 14\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>MSA and SOW paper</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A master services agreement and statement of work ready to sign, covering IP, subcontracting and confidentiality. We sign client paper too, and we have been through that review.</p></article><article class=\"proc-card\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M16 13C13.2386 13 11 11.8807 11 10.5C11 9.11929 13.2386 8 16 8C18.7614 8 21 9.11929 21 10.5C21 11.8807 18.7614 13 16 13Z\"/><path d=\"M11 14.5C11 15.8807 13.2386 17 16 17C18.7614 17 21 15.8807 21 14.5\"/><path d=\"M3 9.5C3 10.8807 5.23858 12 8 12C9.12583 12 10.1647 11.814 11.0005 11.5\"/><path d=\"M3 13C3 14.3807 5.23858 15.5 8 15.5C9.12561 15.5 10.1643 15.314 11 15.0002\"/><path d=\"M3 5.5V16.5C3 17.8807 5.23858 19 8 19C9.12563 19 10.1643 18.8139 11 18.5\"/><path d=\"M13 8.5V5.5\"/><path d=\"M11 10.5V18.5C11 19.8807 13.2386 21 16 21C18.7614 21 21 19.8807 21 18.5V10.5\"/><path d=\"M8 8C5.23858 8 3 6.88071 3 5.5C3 4.11929 5.23858 3 8 3C10.7614 3 13 4.11929 13 5.5C13 6.88071 10.7614 8 8 8Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>PO and AP billing</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>We bill into enterprise accounts payable with a purchase order number on every invoice. Your finance team gets what it needs the first time.</p></article></div><div class=\"proc__badge\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The credential behind every build: the official Enterprise tier of the Webflow partner program.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section shape\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"shape__grid\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><div class=\"shape__left\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The Engagement</span><h2 class=\"shape__heading\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>What a Retainer<br data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Looks Like Month to Month</h2></div><ul class=\"shape__list\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>A retainer with a monthly report</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Monthly scope agreed up front, and anything beyond it quoted before work starts. The number you took to finance is the number on the invoice.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Slack-native, inside a written process</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Requests land in a shared channel and move through documented steps. Because the process is written down, the pace holds even when people are away.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Evidence on a fixed cadence</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>One report a month, same shape every time. You can compare month four to month one in ten seconds.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12C10 14.2091 8.20914 16 6 16C3.79086 16 2 14.2091 2 12C2 9.79086 3.79086 8 6 8C8.20914 8 10 9.79086 10 12ZM10 12H22V15\"/><path d=\"M18 12V15\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Yours from day one</h3><p data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Everything built under the retainer belongs to you immediately. Notice is 60 days after month three, and the work keeps running if you ever leave.</p></li></ul></div><div class=\"weeks\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><h3 class=\"weeks__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Your first month, week by week</h3><ol class=\"weeks__strip\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><li class=\"week\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"week__tag\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Week 1</span><h4 class=\"week__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Access and baseline</h4><p class=\"week__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The Slack channel opens and access is granted under least-privilege rules. We take your AI Readability Score baseline and your analytics baseline, so month one has a start line.</p></li><li class=\"week\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"week__tag\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Week 2</span><h4 class=\"week__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>First builds ship</h4><p class=\"week__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>The highest-value fixes from the baseline go into staging. They go live when you approve them, and never before.</p></li><li class=\"week\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"week__tag\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Week 3</span><h4 class=\"week__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Measurement wired</h4><p class=\"week__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Tracking is checked end to end so the numbers can be trusted. The citation panel is pointed at your domain across four AI engines.</p></li><li class=\"week\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm><span class=\"week__tag\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>Week 4</span><h4 class=\"week__title\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>First report</h4><p class=\"week__text\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>What moved, what it means, and the plan for next month. Written to be forwarded upward as it is.</p></li></ol><p class=\"weeks__foot\" data-astro-cid-uahrdstm>By day 30 you are holding evidence you can forward to your leadership.</p></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:inherit;background:0 0;border:0}.icon-chip--muted[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:#201d1d8c;background:#201d1d0f;border:1px solid #201d1d1a}.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:58%;height:58%;display:block}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:100%;height:100%}",".split-feature[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{background:var(--white)}.split-feature__grid[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}h2[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{font-size:var(--h3);max-width:18ch}.split-feature__body[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{margin-top:var(--sp-3);max-width:55ch}.split-feature__body[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw] p+p{margin-top:var(--sp-2)}.split-feature__link[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{align-items:center;gap:var(--sp-1);margin-top:var(--sp-3);color:var(--blue);text-underline-offset:.2em;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-flex}.split-feature__link[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]:focus-visible{outline-offset:4px;outline:2px solid}img[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{border-radius:var(--radius);width:100%;height:auto}.split-feature__actions--custom[data-astro-cid-gu6y6jkw]{margin-top:var(--sp-3)}@med